# Copy for first setup only; merge settings if .env already exists. Never overwrite keys.
# .env is ignored. The scanner reads process environment; it does not load this file.
# Load trusted shell-compatible settings: set -a; . ./.env; set +a
SCAN_FINDINGS_DIR="$HOME/Dev/zazzcode/zazzles/_test-findings"

# ONE scan-wide model for ALL analyzers. Uncomment exactly one assignment.
# Use --judge openai or --judge gemini to explicitly enable requests.
# JUDGE_DECISION_MODEL=gpt-6-luna
JUDGE_DECISION_MODEL=gemini-decision-1
# Jev: set JUDGE_DECISION_MODEL to your explicit catalog model and use --judge jev.
# Jev transport is stub-tested only; no live account/evaluation is required here.

# Credentials may coexist; only the chosen provider key is used. Never commit real keys.
OPENAI_API_KEY=
GEMINI_API_KEY=
TYPESAFE_API_KEY=

# Google AI Studio key: https://aistudio.google.com/api-keys
# Google uses v1beta Decisions; only gemini-decision-1 is accepted.
# No automatic fallback or paid calls just from loading this file.
# --judge-model must match JUDGE_DECISION_MODEL when both are supplied.
# Lists/competing CLI selections fail before scanning. Never define the model twice:
# shells silently retain the last assignment, which the scanner cannot detect afterward.
# Commenting/removing a setting does not unset an already exported shell variable.
# After switching models: unset JUDGE_DECISION_MODEL; reload this file in a fresh subshell.
# Keep legacy SCAN_OPENAI_MODEL/SCAN_GEMINI_MODEL/SCAN_JEV_MODEL unset.

# Shared judge controls (contract: .zazz/specifications/decision-model-limits.md).
# Implemented in the continuation CLI; final full verification is pending. Older binaries ignore these.
# Per SCAN, not an account/day cap. Flags will override these values; --judge remains explicit.
JUDGE_LIMIT=10
JUDGE_BUDGET_USD=10
# Set the highest applicable input price, including cache-write/regional/long-context premiums.
# Gemini Decision: $0.10/M; conservative Luna example: $0.30/M. Verify your provider's pricing.
JUDGE_INPUT_USD_PER_MILLION=0.10
JUDGE_RPM=60
# Example for a paid Gemini project; verify active project quotas before raising it.
JUDGE_TPM=600000
